  m_text: " - Red Heart symbol appears on reels 1-4 only.\n - It can appear with
    Major, Minor, Mini Jackpots or Credit.\n - Red Heart symbol on a reel triggers
    Heart Floating Spin for that reel. \n - The reel with Heart Floating Spin moves
    down by one spot each spin until Red Heart symbol is not visible. "
