  m_text: " - 6 or more Red Heart symbols triggers Heart Bonus.\r\n - Triggering
    Red Heart symbols get locked and a fully filled row activates Demoness Reel.
    \r\n - From Demoness Reel, only Gold Heart Symbol appears. \r\n - Gold Heart
    Symbol appears with Grand, Mega Jackpots, Credit or Multiplier.\r\n - Gold Heart
    Symbol with a Multiplier applies that Multiplier to the Red Heart Symbols on
    the same row where Gold Heart Symbol with Multiplier appeared."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5316d286fa94a894888ee12767189de0, type: 2}
